('426.mp4', 'Animals: cat. Objects: harness, neon lights. Actions: sitting, walking. Emotions: calm, attentive. Scenes: night, urban, city street, nighttime, city. Concepts: city life, vibrancy, futuristic, urban, technology', 'Animals: cat. Objects: harness, neon lights. Actions: sitting, walking. Emotions: calm, attentive. S...', 'cat, harness, neon lights, sitting, walking, calm, attentive, night, urban, city street, nighttime, city, city life, vibrancy, futuristic, urban, technology', 'A ginger cat wearing a harness sits attentively on a wet city street at night. Neon lights from surrounding buildings illuminate the scene, casting colorful reflections on the pavement. The background is bustling with silhouettes of people walking by.', 'A ginger cat wearing a harness sits attentively on a wet city street at night. In the background, a humanoid robot walks past under the glow of neon lights, creating a futuristic atmosphere.', 'A ginger cat wearing a harness sits attentively on a wet city street at night. In the background, a futuristic cityscape with blurred neon lights and a humanoid figure adds to the scene''s sci-fi atmosphere.', '1056x1888', '33:59', 30.0, '10s'),
